Standards-Version: 4.5.0
Homepage: https://vajra-os.org

Package: vajra-control-center
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, systemd, network-manager, alsa-utils
Recommends: x11-xserver-utils, brightnessctl, redshift
Description: Vajra OS Control Center — system settings (12 sections)
 Central configuration hub for Vajra OS, modeled after Windows Settings
 and macOS System Preferences. Provides 12 settings sections:
 .
  * Display (resolution, brightness, night light, scale)
  * Network (Wi-Fi, Ethernet, DNS, proxy, diagnostics)
  * Sound (volume, output/input devices)
  * Privacy (Tor toggle, data clearing, MAC randomization)
  * Security (firewall, encryption, access control)
  * Language & Region (en_IN, hi_IN, ta_IN, etc.)
  * Time & Date (NTP, timezone)
  * Users & Accounts (add/remove, passwords, groups)
  * Power & Battery (profiles, suspend, CPU governor)
  * Apps & Features (launch app store)
  * Accessibility
  * About (system info with धर्मो रक्षति रक्षितः)
